    "turn_text": "now you're ruining even more people's break. You're gonna cause people to start drinking this morning with stuff like that. Those kind of thoughts. Oh my god. All right, Billy, thank you so much for the call. I do appreciate it. That's funny. Just yeah, I don't even want to think about Nancy Pelosi and one piece either, let alone the Hillary thing. I mean, just I think Earl may have ruined that this morning. I mean, at this point, I don't even I don't even want to think about breakfast because I'm afraid of how I'm going to might react to that. So anyhow. So coming up, we will be chatting with Congressman Neil Dunn. We got him in the studio this morning. And again, we have a lot of things that we want to talk with him about. And of course, if you still have some questions, I do have a bunch of questions that I did get from you guys. But you can send them to me on their Facebook page, facebook.com forward slash the Brian Rush Show. Either comment in the post or just direct message me. And we will try and get as many questions as we can. And I know that he's also got a lot of information to share with us about what's going on in Washington. And it's always good to get a little bit of that insight of what's really, truly going on up there. 2, 3, 3, 9, 9, 8, it's the number. Good morning. Welcome to the Brian Rush Show. Sorry, I missed you. So we will, we will be chatting with him in just a couple of minutes. And also tomorrow, don't forget, I've had this young man on the show before. His name is Victor Nieves. He is basically a social media influencer. And he's been somebody who's had some serious, serious battles with censorship. And he's a great kid, and you guys have loved him when we had him on. So he will be on the show coming up tomorrow. And two, three, three, nine, eight, it's the number. Good morning. Welcome to the Brian Rush show.",
