    "turn_text": "Yeah, probably. It wouldn't surprise me at all. But it's good to hear that. Another one that I know that something that is very close to your heart, which kind of changes subjects a little bit off of the coronavirus, which is about time. We need to stop talking about that. Suzanne in Panama City, she wanted to know about the Democrats that are dismantling Trump's mission to really help the veterans. And with you being a veteran yourself, and that's been an issue that has been at your heart for a very long time, what are you and your fellow colleagues doing to stop this? Because I hear this from veterans all the time, that when Trump was president, I could go get a test, and I could get this done. And then all of a sudden, Biden becomes president, and now I got to travel to Timbuktu to",
