    "turn_text": "And of course, one of the things too that a lot of people don't realize, and we're hearing all of this touting of the unemployment numbers and how much better they are. But when you start taking people out of the workforce and the participation rate, that changes the number and makes it look better, but it's not. And, you know, Biden's",
