    "turn_text": "You know, it's, it's, let me say I spent, I'm also on the Parliament of NATO. And that's really great because it gives me a chance, even through the pandemic, while everybody's locked down, we spend a lot of time with our our allies were forced to. And I want to. And try to understand our other 29 partners in NATO. And I will tell you that I'm grateful for them, all of them, and some of them are harder to be grateful for than",
